{:paths ["src"]
 :version "0.1.0"
 ;; kotoba-lang/text — string/regex/unicode helpers. The stdlib gap every lib
 ;; re-rolls (json/lint/time hand-roll string ops). Zero third-party deps; .cljc.
 ;; Regex uses the host's #"..."; pure string ops are portable. Runs on
 ;; JVM/SCI/CLJS/GraalVM/kotoba-WASM. See ADR-kotoba-lang-foundational-stdlib.md.
